From: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 13:52:08 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] mm/damon/vaddr: setup
 damos_va_migrate_private->sz_filter_passed

Fixup the wrong sz_filter_passed support.

Signed-off-by: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
---
 mm/damon/vaddr.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/mm/damon/vaddr.c b/mm/damon/vaddr.c
index 505e55dc46d15..0dce7ec99f2ed 100644
--- a/mm/damon/vaddr.c
+++ b/mm/damon/vaddr.c
@@ -969,6 +969,7 @@ static unsigned long damos_va_migrate(struct damon_target *target,
 	priv.migration_lists = kmalloc_objs(*priv.migration_lists, nr_dests);
 	if (!priv.migration_lists)
 		return 0;
+	priv.sz_filter_passed = sz_filter_passed;
 
 	for (int i = 0; i < nr_dests; i++)
 		INIT_LIST_HEAD(&priv.migration_lists[i]);
-- 
2.47.3

